  "principles": [
    "Circulation is a branching network, with destinations off it",
    "Provide a landside connector, post-security recovery space and a generous airside concourse",
    "Offset major entrances and exits to create turns, pauses and useful sightlines",
    "Recess each gate approach from the main concourse",
    "Use open framed thresholds where doors serve no function; security and boarding remain controlled",
    "Keep the parked aircraft and jetbridge connection",
    "Room boundaries, furniture relocation and route verification remain to be built"
  ],
